OL,3,AStarlink restrictions affecting
OL,4,AUkraine's front line operations, Kyiv
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeed restrictions on the key Starlink
OL,8,Fcommunications network have disrupted
OL,9,FUkraine's battlefield "missions",
OL,10,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky's adviser
OL,11,Fhas warned.
OL,13,FSerhiy Beskrestnov said Ukrainian
OL,14,Ftroops had not been informed about the
OL,15,Fspeed limits set overnight at 100mph
OL,16,F(160km/h) by Elon Musk's SpaceX
OL,17,Fcompany. A source in the Ukrainian
OL,18,Fdefence ministry later confirmed this
OL,19,Fto the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
