OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AStarlink restrictions affecting
OL,4,AUkraine's front line operations, Kyiv
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FStarlink is a vital tool allowing Kyiv
OL,8,Fto effectively guide drones to Russian
OL,9,Ftargets and also protect Ukrainian
OL,10,Fskies. SpaceX has not publicly
OL,11,Fcommented.
OL,13,FThis comes as at least 600,000 people
OL,14,Facross Ukraine were left without
OL,15,Felectricity after deadly overnight
OL,16,FRussian missile and drone strikes,
OL,17,FZelensky said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
